      "id": "claim_d13347ff2ef344fd825c106f5cd7700e",
      "statement": "`openswe.tools` is a lazy public-tool facade: `_TOOL_MODULES` maps exports to implementation modules, resolved values are cached, and `_LazyToolsModule` prevents an imported same-named submodule from shadowing an export.",
